@startuml
title The shipped decidable theories, lifted to EBAs via TheoryAlgebra

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam interface {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

' ── The three decidable ConstraintTheory implementations ────────────────
component "PresburgerTheory\nStore: linear ≤ atoms + NFA\nNFA non-emptiness (Bartzis–Bultan)\n(Proposition 1)" as Presburger #DCFCE7

component "UnificationTheory\nStore: solved substitution\nMartelli–Montanari + occurs-check\nwitness = mgu (Theorem 2)" as Unification #DCFCE7

component "LatticeTheory\nStore: edges + Warshall closure\nfinite subtype order (Prop 3)\npreorder; partial join/meet" as Lattice #FEF3C7

' ── The bridge and the EBA target ───────────────────────────────────────
component "TheoryAlgebra<T>\nthe bridge (section 2)" as Bridge #E0E7FF

interface "BooleanAlgebra\nSFA, minterms, lint reuse" as BA #DBEAFE

Presburger --> Bridge
Unification --> Bridge
Lattice --> Bridge
Bridge --> BA : lifts theory store into an EBA

note bottom of Bridge
  exact: Some/None, never DontKnow; Z3Theory (2.1) is the deliberate
  semi-decidable exception that stops at Sat3.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Group |
|<#DCFCE7> | decidable theory (exact, regular) |
|<#FEF3C7> | reject-safe (preorder; partial join/meet) |
|<#E0E7FF> | bridge / formal (TheoryAlgebra) |
|<#DBEAFE> | classical EBA target (BooleanAlgebra) |
endlegend
@enduml
